From: OpenDesk <opendesk@openharmony.org>
Date: Thu, 27 Mar 2026 03:20:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lib/posixpath.py: add HarmonyOS default search paths

Change defpath from '/bin:/usr/bin' to '/system/bin:/bin:/usr/bin:/usr/local/bin' for HarmonyOS.

Files modified:
  -3.12.9.orig/Lib/posixpath.py	2025-02-04 22:38:38.000000000 +0800
---
--- Python-3.12.9.orig/Lib/posixpath.py	2025-02-04 22:38:38.000000000 +0800
+++ Python-3.12.9/Lib/posixpath.py	2026-03-27 11:41:10.152162813 +0800
@@ -18,7 +18,7 @@
 extsep = '.'
 sep = '/'
 pathsep = ':'
-defpath = '/bin:/usr/bin'
+defpath = '/system/bin:/bin:/usr/bin:/usr/local/bin'
 altsep = None
 devnull = '/dev/null'
 

-- 
